<view class="page">
  <view class="row-between">
    <view>
      <view class="section-title">WEEKLY</view>
      <view class="card-title" style="font-size: 40rpx;">最近 7 天</view>
    </view>
    <view class="tag" wx:if="{{rangeLabel}}">{{rangeLabel}}</view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="empty">正在整理这 7 天的记录…</view>

  <view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="card center">
    <view class="card-title">这次没有生成成功</view>
    <view class="muted" style="margin: 12rpx 0 28rpx;">{{error}}</view>
    <button class="btn btn-primary" bindtap="onGoRecord">回到记录页</button>
  </view>

  <block wx:elif="{{blocked}}">
    <view class="card">
      <view class="card-title">还差 {{requiredDays - recordedDays}} 天</view>
      <view class="muted" style="margin-bottom: 24rpx;">{{message}}</view>
      <view class="progress-track">
        <view class="progress-fill" style="width: {{progress}}%;"></view>
      </view>
      <view class="row-between muted small" style="margin-top: 12rpx;">
        <view>已记录 {{recordedDays}} 天</view>
        <view>满 {{requiredDays}} 天可生成</view>
      </view>
    </view>

    <view class="card">
      <view class="card-title">怎么算「有效记录」</view>
      <view class="muted">同一天只算 1 天。重复提交会更新当天记录，不会增加天数；记录只存在本机。</view>
    </view>

    <button class="btn btn-primary" bindtap="onGoRecord">去记录今天</button>
  </block>

  <block wx:else>
    <view class="card">
      <view class="row-between">
        <view>
          <view class="muted small">这 7 天你记录了</view>
          <view style="font-size: 54rpx; font-weight: 700; color: #2f4b38;">{{recordedDays}} 天</view>
        </view>
        <view class="tag {{counterCount > 0 ? 'tag-warm' : ''}}">
          {{counterCount > 0 ? counterCount + ' 个反常识模式' : '暂无标为反常识'}}
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="muted small" style="margin-top: 8rpx;">只统计最近 7 天（含今天），不是自然周。</view>
    </view>

    <view wx:for="{{patterns}}" wx:key="title" class="card">
      <view class="row-between" style="margin-bottom: 12rpx;">
        <view class="card-title" style="margin-bottom: 0; flex: 1;">{{item.title}}</view>
        <view class="tag {{item.isCounterIntuitive ? 'tag-warm' : ''}}" style="margin-left: 16rpx;">
          {{item.isCounterIntuitive ? '反常识' : '模式'}}
        </view>
      </view>
      <view class="muted" style="font-size: 28rpx;">{{item.description}}</view>
    </view>

    <view class="card">
      <view class="card-title">把 7 天拉长到一个月</view>
      <view class="muted" style="margin-bottom: 24rpx;">当月记录满 10 天，可生成月角色卡：状态分布、Top 场景、例外 / 张力，以及一条轻量建议。</view>
      <button class="btn btn-ghost" bindtap="onOpenMonthly">查看月角色卡</button>
    </view>

    <button class="btn btn-link" bindtap="onGoRecord">补记 / 修改今天</button>
  </block>

  <view class="footer-note">
    每个模式都带数量或日期锚点；「反常识」只是与常见周节奏不同，不是性格结论。
  </view>
</view>
